    "identifier": "keton-plasma-release-stellar-wave",
    "description": "<p>You compress plasma into an orb you can hold before releasing the compressed energy into a wave of destruction. All creatures in range must make a Dexterity saving throw taking 5d6 fire damage on a failure, or half as much on a success. If this jutsu would affect a Barrier or a creature with temporary hit points, reduce the Barrier and temporary hit points by half before calculating damage against the appropriate creatures.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d10+1, and the range by 5ft.</p>",
